; Second independent audit after the first board returned REVISE.
; The Form-native review flow persists every answer before collection.
import "../form/form-stdlib/core.fk"
import "review-panel.fk"
import "review-ask.fk"

(ra-review
  "observe/session-neutral-semantic-frequency-live.fk"
  "Post-repair adversarial verification only; do not edit any file. Read the current cognition/session-neutral-semantic-frequency.fk, its band, this live witness, cognition/concept-text-roundtrip-10000-13.fk, and its 130000-cell supply audit. The first review returned REVISE for erased casing, empty supplied tokens becoming residues, undefined empty-denominator ratios impersonating 100%, broad rather than exact fixture assertions, a missing # ambiguity assertion, a live sentence contradicted by coincident counts, and an exhaustive collision audit that did not accumulate same-surface identity. Verify each repair directly. Arrival casing must remain exact while an explicitly labeled ASCII-fold fallback may address the same neutral concept; trust/Trust/TRUST must share concept 490 while carrying self-centered/context-carried/field-centered expression facets. Treat that casing interpretation as this authored expression convention, not a universal linguistic fact. Empty supplied tokens must disappear and all empty coverage ratios must be -1. The band must assert exact 22/22/12 NL, 7/7/5 PL, Indonesian ya=16, !/*/#/=>=2 each, and trust across 13/13 lexical locales, returning 33554431. The exhaustive audit must now count 130000/130000 candidate groups whose every ID regenerates the same byte-identical surface, include that in zero failures, and still return score 2047. Re-measure the current request and prior-response fixture: expected candidate coverage is 46/46 and 651/657 (99.08%), while field evidence is 15/46 and 480/657; do not confuse candidate availability with contextual sense selection or authored field evidence. Confirm printable ASCII plus 71 common Unicode alias seats remains a finite session dictionary, not all Unicode, all PL operators, arbitrary identifier semantics, productive CJK/Japanese segmentation, phrase/meme semantics, intrinsic word frequency, or universal field geometry. Return PASS AS A BOUNDED SESSION TOKEN-TO-NEUTRAL-CANDIDATE AND EXPRESSION-FACET OBSERVER, REVISE, or BLOCK. Locate any executable defect or overclaim and name the smallest coherent repair. Empty or unavailable doors are absence, never votes.")
